## Context

Fleet audit 2026-07-13: the generated `## Status` block spends five of its
nine lines on `git log --oneline -5`, which duplicates the session-start git
snapshot. The unique automated value today is one ticket-count line. The
author authorized investing cycles at refresh time so each generated line
answers a distinct reader question — what awaits the human, what is half-done,
is main safe to build on, what just landed — across the reading situations
(session start, reactivation, cross-repo scan, forge browsing, bare subagent).

## Relevant files
- `scripts/refresh-STATE.py` — `format_status`, `get_tickets`, `get_commits`
- `tests/test_refresh_state.py` — format and JSON-schema contract tests
- `rules/state.md` — minimal template must show the enriched shape

## Actions
1. Generated comment carries an as-of anchor: `<!-- generated <ts> · as of <short-sha> -->`
   (reactivation catch-up recipe: `git log <sha>..HEAD`).
2. Tickets line adds the needs-human count (`N awaiting author`, from erg
   `labels`) plus a second line naming the top 2 ready tickets (id + truncated title).
3. In-flight line: open merge requests (count, drafts, oldest age) and last CI
   conclusion on main — via the forge CLI, omitted gracefully when the CLI or
   remote is absent.
4. Commits list becomes `git log --oneline --first-parent -3` (merge-level
   history: more work per line in merge-commit repos).
5. Update the `rules/state.md` template; stay within `## Status` ≤ 20 lines.

## Test
- `format_status` renders the enriched block from fixture inputs (red first).
- `get_tickets` extracts awaiting-author count and top-ready titles from the
  real erg JSON schema (field is `labels`, not `tags`).
- Forge-CLI absent → in-flight/CI line omitted, script still succeeds.

## Verification
- [ ] Generated block ≤ 20 lines on this repo
- [ ] Script succeeds in a repo with no forge remote
- [ ] `make check` passes

## Invariants
- Guard behavior from ticket 0268 (abort on customized heading, append when
  absent) unchanged.
- Hand sections after `## Status` preserved verbatim.

## Exit criteria
- The enriched block replaces the commits-only format, tested, template updated.
